SUMMARY:My Cousin Vlad & Balkan Comedy Night
LOCATION:Brooklyn
DESCRIPTION:Eastville Comedy Club is Brooklyn's oldest comedy clubGet ready
  for an unforgettable night of comedy as international comedy sensation My
  Cousin Vlad brings his wildly popular\, high-energy stand-up show to North
  America.Macedonian-Australian comedian My Cousin Vlad has built a massive
  international following with millions of views across social media\, earni
 ng fans with his razor-sharp observations\, unforgettable characters and hi
 larious takes on family\, culture and everyday life.Vlad's comedy draws fro
 m his experiences growing up in a Balkan immigrant family in Australia and 
 the hilarious collision between old-school traditions and modern life. From
  marriage\, kids and chaotic family gatherings to tradie culture\, corporat
 e life\, building a duplex and the characters you meet along the way\, Vlad
  turns the everyday into fast-paced\, brutally funny stand-up.His unique st
 yle blends clever storytelling\, spot-on impressions\, quick improvisation
  and sharp observational comedy into a show that feels distinctly Balkan wh
 ile remaining relatable to audiences from every background.Whether he's pok
 ing fun at Balkan traditions\, navigating modern Australian life or exposin
 g the universal insanity of family\, My Cousin Vlad delivers an authentic\
 , unpredictable and uniquely hilarious comedy experience.The night also fea
 tures Balkan Comedy Night founder Ryan Radusinovic\, who has been featured
  on CBS\, Amazon Prime\, Just For Laughs and the Netflix Is a Joke Festiva
 l. His comedy blends animated storytelling\, pitch-perfect impressions\, cl
 ever observations and merciless roasts. Ryan has opened for Bill Burr\, Ya
 nnis Pappas\, Cedric the Entertainer and Pablo Francisco\, and currently to
 urs with Jack Jr.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/m
 y-cousin-vlad-balkan-comedy-night/
